Hello,

The problem is that you have a lapply() nested in by(), so you will have
to rbind twice.
It seems that


results_by_date <- by(
   data,
   data[,"Date"],
   function(subdata) {
     lapply(
       alertlevels,
       check_cutpoints2,
       data=subdata,
       mycolumn=column
     ) |> do.call(rbind, args = _)
   }
) |> do.call(rbind, args = _)


can solve it.
Can you post the output of dput(results_by_date[1:2]) ?

Hope this helps,

Rui Barradas


